{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2015-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1438387200, "end_date": 1438991999, "month_true_total": 139, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:10:20 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "17435227", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041597336", "personaname": "durumu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198041597336/", "num_games_owned": 387, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 2567, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 615, "last_played": 1595732110, "avatar": "badd660e9fb81da56d5770c103dd10a94c76a590"}, "language": "english", "review": "Super fun co op mode, and the single player is challenging but very rewarding.", "timestamp_created": 1438986079, "timestamp_updated": 1438986079, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "17425372", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056209602", "personaname": "wagyu beefme", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jfuckingma/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 739, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 307, "last_played": 1654106463, "avatar": "d86b956e8d2a147275455e7b184518863ef37d5d"}, "language": "english", "review": "You stop you die.\nStop you die.\nYou die.\nDie.", "timestamp_created": 1438932119, "timestamp_updated": 1438932119, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "17419806", "author": {"steamid": "76561198065168463", "personaname": "rivers", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sadderDX/", "num_games_owned": 365, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 4987, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1343, "last_played": 1625438423, "avatar": "06c969eaa23b678a93567bbb5832b29bcc873ff7"}, "language": "english", "review": "MAGMA WORMS", "timestamp_created": 1438894547, "timestamp_updated": 1438894547, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519114196300506592", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "17417765", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083892258", "personaname": "wheatstoneholmes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wheatstoneholmes/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 7224, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6162, "last_played": 1599339915, "avatar": "59305ce329204cff4d0370a0ce4f1bd025758cec"}, "language": "english", "review": "Addictive! Keyboard and gampad support. Achievements work now! And it does rain (on the last level)!\n\nThis game is like someone took modern game mechanics and used a time machine to go back to the 80's and built the best arcade game they could out of 80's tech.\n\nReminds me of something from the Commodore 64 (or 1984 Amiga), going into it for the first time is confusing, but fun!\n\nYou basically explore a planet looking for the transporter, as time goes by enemies spawn and if you hang around too long the enemies spawn faster and are harder versions!\n\nIt does seem very hard at first, but don't give up. If you keep playing you unlock better items that will help you die further into the game and then unlock more items, etc.\n\nEven when you have some awesome items like my favorite, Tesla coil and a lot of health items your character is still fragile so you have to have a stratigic approach, you can't always go plunging into a group of enemies guns a blazin', but sometimes you can!\n\nEverything is balanced well and the game play is great!\n\nEach character is very different and requires another style of game play.\n\nAlso, developers: PLEASE make a bigger, badder sequel with even more items!!!", "timestamp_created": 1438885049, "timestamp_updated": 1440260023, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "17417146", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038374301", "personaname": "anu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/akhanubis/", "num_games_owned": 1558, "num_reviews": 143, "playtime_forever": 2138, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1874, "last_played": 1542425244, "avatar": "07e8defd534d553c5f6d1f58d81ccb26f57d83e3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, specially with friends. Nice replayability.", "timestamp_created": 1438882138, "timestamp_updated": 1438882138, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.556248247623443604", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}